cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its weights, please cite the technical report below."
type: software
title: "SOLFIRE: Solar Filament Refined Ensemble"
abstract: >-
  Calibrated three-family ensemble (ResNet34, MiT-B2, HRNet-W32) with a crop
  refiner and label-free barb growth for segmenting solar filaments in GONG
  H-alpha observations, submitted to the Solar Filament Segmentation
  Challenge 2026.
